        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 1, DAL 0",
        "text": "Matthew Poitras one-timed Frederic Brunet's cross-ice pass from the left circle at 2:09 for a 1–0 lead."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 2, DAL 1",
        "text": "Mikko Rantanen buried a rebound at 2:50 to tie it 1–1. James Hagens put Boston back in front at 7:30, redirecting Casey Mittelstadt's feed from behind the net over Jake Oettinger's pad for a 2–1 lead."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "BOS 2, DAL 2",
        "text": "Dallas managed only two shots on goal in the period, but one tied it: at 13:38, Charlie McAvoy blocked a Roope Hintz shot and the puck caromed to Rantanen in the right circle, who made it 2–2."
      },
      {
        "label": "Overtime",
        "score": "Final: DAL 3, BOS 2 (OT)",
        "text": "Jeremy Swayman stopped two Wyatt Johnston breakaways in overtime. The winner came on a 4-on-3 after Pavel Zacha was called for slashing Thomas Harley: Rantanen stickhandled to the net and backhanded it over Swayman's glove at 3:52 to complete the hat trick."
      }
    ],
